- New Customers: {{ $json.today.new_customers }}
- Churned: {{ $json.today.churned }}

Week to Date:
- Revenue: ₹{{ $json.week.revenue }}

Month to Date:
- Revenue: ₹{{ $json.month.revenue }}
- Active Customers: {{ $json.month.active_customers }}

Top Product Today: {{ $json.top_product }} ({{ $json.top_product_units }} units)

Write a 2-3 sentence daily business narrative. Be direct, specific with numbers. If today is down vs yesterday, acknowledge it. If up, say why it might be (day of week, recent campaign). End with one specific recommended action.

Return JSON: {"narrative": "", "status": "strong/good/average/watch", "action": ""}

